<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<kml xmlns="http://www.opengis.net/kml/2.2"><Document>
<name>Chumphon sidewalk route G9 (10-group plan)</name>
<Style id="g9film"><LineStyle><color>ffd65f5a</color><width>5</width></LineStyle></Style>
<Style id="g9opt"><LineStyle><color>99d65f5a</color><width>4</width></LineStyle></Style>
<Style id="g9con"><LineStyle><color>ff8a8a8a</color><width>2</width></LineStyle></Style>
<Folder><name>Group 9</name>
<Placemark><name>G9 START</name><description>Junction of Krommaluang Chumphon Rd (ถ.กรมหลวงชุมพร) &amp; Soi Krumluang Chumphon 5</description><Point><coordinates>99.18606,10.4997,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>G9 step 1: Krommaluang Chumphon Rd</name><description>Start here. Head east along Krommaluang Chumphon Rd (ถ.กรมหลวงชุมพร) for about 390 m, passing Soi Krumluang Chumphon 6, Soi Krumluang Chumphon 13, to where it meets Footpath to the Krom Luang Chumphon Monument (ทางเดินไปพระอนุสาวรีย์กรมหลวงชุมพรฯ).</description><styleUrl>#g9film</styleUrl><LineString><tessellate>1</tessellate><coordinates>99.18606,10.4997,0 99.18759,10.49966,0 99.188,10.49947,0 99.18846,10.49936,0 99.18838,10.49922,0 99.18862,10.49917,0 99.18878,10.49914,0 99.18928,10.49904,0 99.1893,10.49903,0</coordinates></LineString></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>G9 step 2: Footpath to the Krom Luang Chumphon Monument</name><description>Turn right onto Footpath to the Krom Luang Chumphon Monument (ทางเดินไปพระอนุสาวรีย์กรมหลวงชุมพรฯ), heading south for about 140 m to where it meets Circle around the Krom Luang Chumphon Monument (วงรอบพระอนุสาวรีย์กรมหลวงชุมพรฯ).</description><styleUrl>#g9film</styleUrl><LineString><tessellate>1</tessellate><coordinates>99.1893,10.49903,0 99.18923,10.49878,0 99.18926,10.49876,0 99.18929,10.49874,0 99.1893,10.49871,0 99.18931,10.49868,0 99.1893,10.49864,0 99.18928,10.49861,0 99.18926,10.49859,0 99.18923,10.49858,0 99.18919,10.49858,0 99.18902,10.49786,0</coordinates></LineString></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>G9 step 3: Circle around the Krom Luang Chumphon Monument</name><description>Bear right onto Circle around the Krom Luang Chumphon Monument (วงรอบพระอนุสาวรีย์กรมหลวงชุมพรฯ), heading south-west for about 110 m to the next junction.</description><styleUrl>#g9film</styleUrl><LineString><tessellate>1</tessellate><coordinates>99.18902,10.49786,0 99.18897,10.49789,0 99.18884,10.49782,0 99.18875,10.49773,0 99.18871,10.49762,0 99.18877,10.49738,0 99.18899,10.49718,0</coordinates></LineString></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>G9 step 4: Circle around the Krom Luang Chumphon Monument</name><description>Bear left to stay on Circle around the Krom Luang Chumphon Monument (วงรอบพระอนุสาวรีย์กรมหลวงชุมพรฯ), heading east for about 130 m to where it meets the connecting lane.</description><styleUrl>#g9film</styleUrl><LineString><tessellate>1</tessellate><coordinates>99.18899,10.49718,0 99.18917,10.4972,0 99.18926,10.49725,0 99.18939,10.49755,0 99.18934,10.49774,0 99.18902,10.49786,0</coordinates></LineString></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>G9 step 5: the connecting lane (connect only)</name><description>Turn left and walk along the connecting lane, heading south-west for about 100 m to where it meets Lane inside the sports ground (ถนนภายในสนามกีฬา). [Connecting walk - no filming needed]</description><styleUrl>#g9con</styleUrl><LineString><tessellate>1</tessellate><coordinates>99.18902,10.49786,0 99.18902,10.49786,0 99.18896,10.49764,0 99.18893,10.49764,0 99.18889,10.49763,0 99.18886,10.49761,0 99.18885,10.49758,0 99.18884,10.49755,0 99.18884,10.49751,0 99.18886,10.49748,0 99.18888,10.49745,0 99.18891,10.49744,0 99.18886,10.49721,0 99.18899,10.49718,0</coordinates></LineString></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>G9 step 6: Lane inside the sports ground</name><description>Bear right onto Lane inside the sports ground (ถนนภายในสนามกีฬา), heading south-west for about 150 m to the next junction.</description><styleUrl>#g9film</styleUrl><LineString><tessellate>1</tessellate><coordinates>99.18899,10.49718,0 99.18886,10.49721,0 99.18877,10.49678,0 99.18849,10.49678,0 99.18833,10.49673,0 99.18815,10.49663,0 99.18803,10.49662,0</coordinates></LineString></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>G9 step 7: Lane inside the sports ground (connect only)</name><description>Bear right and walk along Lane inside the sports ground (ถนนภายในสนามกีฬา), heading west for about 30 m to where it meets Soi Krumluang Chumphon 6. [Connecting walk - no filming needed]</description><styleUrl>#g9con</styleUrl><LineString><tessellate>1</tessellate><coordinates>99.18803,10.49662,0 99.1879,10.49666,0 99.18774,10.4967,0</coordinates></LineString></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>G9 step 8: Soi Krumluang Chumphon 6</name><description>Turn right onto Soi Krumluang Chumphon 6, heading north for about 290 m to the finish point.</description><styleUrl>#g9film</styleUrl><LineString><tessellate>1</tessellate><coordinates>99.18774,10.4967,0 99.18783,10.49707,0 99.18789,10.49728,0 99.18807,10.498,0 99.18838,10.49922,0</coordinates></LineString></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>G9 FINISH</name><description>Junction of Soi Krumluang Chumphon 6 &amp; Krommaluang Chumphon Rd (ถ.กรมหลวงชุมพร)</description><Point><coordinates>99.18838,10.49922,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark></Folder>
</Document></kml>